{"version":1,"content":"<p>楊千嬅堂大伯、丁子高堂哥丁子峻昔以長髮俊朗外表見稱，近年改以短頭髮示人，近日他網晒新相，與不丹國王旺楚克同框合照，見他幾乎剃光頭，身穿白Tee配黑色長袍，胸前戴上佛珠與吊墜，打扮富禪意，引起外間揣測「出家」。</p><p>其實丁子峻過去亦曾因為一張剃頭照</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.416442+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T14:01:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T16:57:29.399097+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"5b2cb1cc2a79eed2035eb143508a65d0d0fb0f028552ff57aeb3beca71a05666","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}